* Solidity ABI\nencoding
** abi.encode
*** Padded to 32 bytes
*** Unambiguous
*** Safe for hashing
** abi.encodePacked
*** Tightly packed
*** Shorter output
*** Hash collision risk\nwith dynamic types
** abi.encodeWithSignature
*** Prepends the\nfunction selector
*** Used for low-level\ncalls
** Security
*** Collisions between\nconcatenated strings
*** Prefer abi.encode\nfor keccak256
** Tooling
*** Slither
*** Aderyn
